OL,3,GNEWSA'Miracle' recovery from sepsis
OL,4,Acaused by a roast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was given just hours to live
OL,7,Fafter a pub roast dinner led to him
OL,8,Fdeveloping sepsis said he has been
OL,9,Fgiven a "second chance" at life.
OL,11,FUdhyam Amin, from Kingswood, Surrey,
OL,12,Fspent more than two weeks in an induced
OL,13,Fcoma in February after what he thought
OL,14,Fwas food poisoning turned out to be
OL,15,Fsepsis.
OL,17,FAhead of World Sepsis Day on Sunday,
OL,18,Fthe 64-year-old, now back at work,
OL,19,Ffeels indebted to the medical team at
OL,20,FSt Helier Hospital in south London.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
